    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. I'll call the service provider now. I'm also worried about why this happened so suddenly. The maintenance logs showed the unit was serviced last week and everything seemed fine. It feels like something just went wrong all at once with the mechanics. Is there any way to tell if this was a mechanical failure or maybe something actually interfered with the sensors?",
